c every run of CLIQUES makes at least 2^(k+1)-1 = 3 recursive calls (one run with min-label tie-breaking and increasing order: 21)
c vertices: guards g_i = 1..1; core a_i = k+2i-1, b_i = k+2i (2..3); witnesses 4..11, 4 per core vertex in the order a_1, b_1, a_2, ...
